{"id":777,"date":"2013-06-25T15:25:19","date_gmt":"2013-06-25T15:25:19","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/?page_id=777"},"modified":"2013-11-10T10:48:06","modified_gmt":"2013-11-10T10:48:06","slug":"useful-info","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/edinburgh2013\/useful-info\/","title":{"rendered":"Useful Info"},"content":{"rendered":"<h1>Contacts<\/h1>\n<p align=\"justify\">For all enquiries relating to the workshop, please email <a href=\"mailto:info@swat4ls.org\">info@swat4ls.org<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>For updates, please visit <a href=\"http:\/\/swat4ls.blogspot.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">the swat4ls blog<\/a> or register to the feed (<a href=\"http:\/\/swat4ls.blogspot.com\/feeds\/posts\/default\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Atom<\/a>).<\/p>\n<p align=\"justify\">An emergency phone number will be provided after registration.<\/p>\n<p><a name=\"dates\"><\/a><\/p>\n<h1>Dates<\/h1>\n<p><strong>Key dates:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Submission opening:                     July 10, 2013<\/li>\n<li>Expression of interest for tutorials:         August 5, 2013<\/li>\n<li>Papers submission deadline (abstracts):       September 15, 2013<\/li>\n<li>Papers submission deadline (full text):       September 22, 2013<\/li>\n<li>Posters and demos submission deadline:        October 18, 2013<\/li>\n<li><font color=\"red\">Early registration deadline:                   October 29th, 2013<\/font><\/li>\n<li>Communication of acceptance:            November 4, 2013<\/li>\n<li>Camera ready paper:                     November 18, 2013<\/li>\n<li>Tutorials                       Mon, December 9, 2013 <\/li>\n<li>Workshop                        Tues, December 10, 2013<\/li>\n<li>Hackathon                            Wed-Thu, December 11-12, 2013 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/edinburgh2013\/scientific-programme\/\"> see program for details<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><a name=\"location\"><\/a><\/p>\n<h1>Locations<\/h1>\n<h3>Royal Society of Edinburgh<\/h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/06\/48643519-3A46-4902-A941-84816DEB0E4B@lan.jpeg\" alt=\"\" title=\"Royal society\" width=\"675\" height=\"319\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-827\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/06\/48643519-3A46-4902-A941-84816DEB0E4B@lan.jpeg 675w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/06\/48643519-3A46-4902-A941-84816DEB0E4B@lan-300x141.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px\" \/>\n<\/p>\n<p>The workshop will take place at the Royal Society of Edinburgh (RSE), which is centrally located in Edinburgh, about 5 min walking from Edinburgh&#8217;s main train station (Waverley Station), and only about 3 min from Princess Street. <\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/06\/7DE07A7B-C4B4-4B07-82FA-D4ED91B9DB28@lan.jpeg\" alt=\"\" title=\"conference room\" width=\"150\" height=\"237\" class=\"alignleft size-full wp-image-829\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Presentations will be held in the <a href=\"http:\/\/www.rsescotlandfoundation.org.uk\/conference_centre\/facilities\/wolfson_lecture_theatre\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RSE&#8217;s Wolfson Lecture Theatre<\/a>, catering and poster presentations are organised in the RSE&#8217;s Wellcome East and Wellcome West rooms. <\/p>\n<p>For a detailed description of the RSE&#8217;s conference facilities, please take a look at <a href=\"http:\/\/www.rsescotlandfoundation.org.uk\/conference_centre\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Conference centre page<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>Details how to reach the RSE can be found <a href=\"http:\/\/www.rsescotlandfoundation.org.uk\/conference_centre\/location\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p><\/br><\/p>\n<h3>Edinburgh School of Informatics<\/h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/09\/6F13A2E9-C44F-4BAE-ACEA-0D6A3C6DB6A6@lan-300x205.jpg\" alt=\"\" title=\"edim-informatics\" width=\"300\" height=\"205\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-846\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/09\/6F13A2E9-C44F-4BAE-ACEA-0D6A3C6DB6A6@lan-300x205.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/09\/6F13A2E9-C44F-4BAE-ACEA-0D6A3C6DB6A6@lan.jpeg 400w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>The tutorials and the hackathon are kindly hosted by The University of Edinburgh&#8217;s School of Informatics. The School can be found in the Informatics Forum, about 10-15min walking from Waverley Station.<br \/>\n For details on the location of the Forum, please see here: <a href=\"http:\/\/www.ed.ac.uk\/schools-departments\/informatics\/about\/location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http:\/\/www.ed.ac.uk\/schools-departments\/informatics\/about\/location<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p><a name=\"howtoreach\"><\/a><\/p>\n<h1>How to reach the venue<a name=\"howtoreach\"><\/a><\/h1>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" src=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps?f=q&amp;source=s_q&amp;hl=it&amp;geocode=&amp;q=Royal+society+George+Street,+Edinburgh,+EH2+2PQ&amp;aq=&amp;sll=55.953002,-3.200845&amp;sspn=0.009827,0.023539&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;hq=Royal+society&amp;hnear=George+St,+Edinburgh,+City+of+Edinburgh+EH2,+Regno+Unito&amp;t=m&amp;cid=16657422441894281728&amp;ll=55.969764,-3.193588&amp;spn=0.046112,0.109863&amp;z=13&amp;iwloc=A&amp;output=embed\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" src=\"https:\/\/www.google.com\/maps?f=q&amp;source=s_q&amp;hl=it&amp;geocode=&amp;q=School+of+Informatics+-+University+of+Edinburgh&amp;aq=&amp;sll=55.942375,-3.233414&amp;sspn=0.078638,0.188313&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;hq=School+of+Informatics+-+University+of+Edinburgh&amp;hnear=&amp;t=m&amp;cid=8523693283243371046&amp;ll=55.962174,-3.180714&amp;spn=0.046121,0.109863&amp;z=13&amp;iwloc=A&amp;output=embed\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<h1>Hotels<\/h1>\n<p>Edinburgh is a popular tourist destination and consequently has a large number and range of acccommodation options. SWAT4LS does not have any specific arrangements with any of the B&#038;Bs, guest houses and hotels listed below, but provide this information simply for the convenience of SWAT4LS attendees. <\/p>\n<p>The usual sources, such as <a href=\"http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.co.uk\" title=\"Tripadvisor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tripadvisor.co.uk<\/a>, <a href=\"http:\/\/www.booking.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">booking.com<\/a> will provide extensive lists of available accommodation in Edinburgh. <\/p>\n<p> A <strong>site maintained by Edinburgh University<\/strong> of potential accommodation can be found <a href=\"http:\/\/www.edinburghfirst.co.uk\/for-accommodation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here<\/a>. <\/p>\n<p><strong>A list of accommodation options<\/strong> in the area of The Informatics Forum, where the SWAT4LS tutorial and hackathon days are hosted, can be found <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/06\/B-Bs-May-2011-2.doc\">here<\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Contacts For all enquiries relating to the workshop, please email info@swat4ls.org. For updates, please visit the swat4ls blog or register to the feed (Atom). An emergency phone number will be provided after registration. Dates Key dates: Submission opening: July 10, &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/www.swat4ls.org\/workshops\/edinburgh2013\/useful-info\/\">Continue reading <span class=\"meta-nav\">&rarr;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":274,"parent":767,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""